[SIZE="4"][B]Device information[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]Device: LG L5 II (LG-E450g), codename vee5ss
[*]SoC: MediaTek MT6575, Cortex-A9
[*]Display: 480x800 WVGA, video-mode DSI panel
[*]Storage: eMMC (system mmcblk0p8, cache mmcblk0p9, data mmcblk0p10)
[*]Stock Android: 4.1.2 Jelly Bean, firmware E450g04a
[*]Kernel: Linux 3.4.0 built from LG's E450g kernel source
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Bug reports[/B][/SIZE]

Include your exact model and stock firmware, what you did, what happened, and [I]/tmp/recovery.log[/I] ([I]adb pull /tmp/recovery.log[/I]). Do not report issues from other L5 II variants.

